# CVE-2026-33997 is a Docker Engine *daemon* flaw in `docker plugin install`
# privilege checks, fixed in Engine 29.3.1. This repo only imports
# github.com/docker/docker as a client of an already-running daemon (the
# sandbox adapter). That Go module is deprecated and frozen at
# v28.5.2+incompatible — there is no v29 tag consumers can `go get`.
# Migrating to github.com/moby/moby/{client,api} is a separate breaking
# SDK change and does not ship the daemon plugin-install path either.
CVE-2026-33997
